    "summary": "Model eligibility — **HERETIC ASTARTES** / **INFANTRY**. When your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts, you can pick a **HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY CHARACTER** from your army. **EPIC HEROES** are excluded. The bearer uses the selected model’s datasheet abilities in place of its own and gains its **PSYKER** keyword if present. The effect expires when your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts.",
